e and pure greys.\n- Corners: Moderately rounded.\n- Whitespace: Regular.\n\n## Colors\n\n- **Primary (#436ac1):** The accent. Primary buttons, links and selected states.\n- **Surface (#f6f6f7):** The background of every screen.\n- **Surface container (#ffffff):** Cards and panels.\n- **On surface (#1a1b1b):** Text.\n- **On surface variant (#636364):** Captions and metadata.\n- **Outline variant (#dadbdb):** Borders and dividers.\n\n## Typography\n\nPlus Jakarta Sans for headlines and body text. A warm humanist sans-serif: approachable everyday consumer apps.\n\n## Layout\n\nContent sits directly on the page like a document, separated by whitespace and hairline rules. Do not use cards.\n\n## Elevation & Depth\n\nCards float: each casts a soft, wide drop shadow. There are no borders; the shadow does the work.\n\n## Shapes\n\nModerately rounded. The base radius is 7px.\n\n## Do's and Don'ts\n\n- Don't use photographs or illustrations; they would be decoration here.\n- Do use icons to mark what a screen is about.\n","seed":0,"change":{},"report":{"name":"gev design","theme":{"vars":{"--k-page":"#f6f6f7","--k-card":"#ffffff","--k-text":"#1a1b1b","--k-muted":"#636364","--k-accent":"#436ac1","--k-on-accent":"#ffffff","--k-accent-soft":"#dfe4f0","--k-border":"#dadbdb","--k-danger":"#d01d21","--k-success":"#1a7f4e","--k-warning":"#a15c00","--k-star":"#e6a100","--k-input":"#ffffff","--k-input-text":"#1a1b1b","--k-card-shadow":"0 1px 2px #14203a14, 0 8px 28px #14203a1f","--k-card-border":"0","--k-radius-sm":"4px","--k-radius-md":"7px","--k-radius-card":"11px","--k-radius-button":"7px","--k-radius-input":"7px","--k-radius-chip":"9999px","--k-space-xs":"4px","--k-space-sm":"8px","--k-space-md":"16px","--k-space-lg":"28px","--k-space-xl":"48px","--k-margin":"16px","--k-card-pad":"16px","--k-button-pad":"9px 18px","--k-input-pad":"10px 13px","--k-display-font":"\"Plus Jakarta Sans\", system-ui, sans-serif","--k-display-size":"30px","--k-display-weight":"700","--k-display-line":"1